WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Ekele diri Allah. Anyị na-eto Ya, na-arịọ Ya maka enyemaka, ma na-arịọ mgbaghara Ya.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Anyị na-arịọ nchebe n’aka Allah pụọ n’ọjọọ nke obi anyị na omume ọjọọ anyị.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Onye Allah duru, ọ dịghị onye ga-edu ya n’ụzọ ọjọọ, onye Ọ hapụrụ, ọ dịghị onye ga-edu ya n’ụzọ ọma.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ana m ekweta na ọ dịghị chi ọzọ ma e wezụga Allah naanị Ya, enweghị onye òtù.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Ana m ekweta na Muhammad bụ ohu Ya na onye ozi Ya.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Unu ndị kwere ekwe, tụọnụ egwu Allah dịka o kwesịrị.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Unu ghara ịnwụ ma e wezụga dịka ndị Musulumi.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Tụọnụ egwu Onyenwe unu, Onye kere unu site n’otu mkpụrụ obi.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
O si n’ime ya kee nwunye ya, wee gbasaa ọtụtụ mmadụ.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Tụọnụ egwu Allah ma kwuo eziokwu.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Ọ ga-eme ka omume unu dị mma ma gbaghara unu mmehie unu.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Onye na-erubere Allah na Onye ozi Ya isi, enwetala mmeri dị ukwuu.